## 4. Architecture

### 4.1 System topology

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  CONTROL LAYER                                                │
│  Stage 1: sclang (complete)                                   │
│  Stages 2+: Python process (mutation, bridge, MPE, UI)        │
│                                                               │
│  Responsibilities:                                            │
│  - FrequencySet state (list of ratios)                        │
│  - Mutation engine (Sethares roughness)                       │
│  - Bass/drone selector (most consonant member)                │
│  - MPE voice allocator + pitch bend math                      │
│  - Loop transport / buffer management                         │
│  - UI / MIDI button handling                                  │
│  - Sends OSC to scsynth                                       │
│  - Sends MPE MIDI to IAC Driver → Ableton                     │
└─────────────┬────────────────────────────┬────────────────────┘
              │ OSC                        │ MIDI (MPE via IAC)
┌─────────────▼────────────────┐  ┌────────▼─────────────────────┐
│  AUDIO SERVER (scsynth)       │  │  ABLETON LIVE                 │
│                               │  │                               │
│  SoundIn(0,1) → Tartini →     │  │  - Audio input: BlackHole 64ch│
│    AutotuneCh0/1              │  │  - MPE synth tracks           │
│  LoopBuf[N] → Tartini →       │  │  - VST/AU hosting             │
│    AutotuneLoop[N]            │  │  - Final mixing, monitoring   │
│  Granular FX bus              │  │  - Bass/drone (MPE synth)     │
│                               │  │                               │
│  Output: Aggregate Device     │  │  Output: physical interface   │
│  (physical + BlackHole 64ch)  │  │                               │
└─────────────┬────────────────┘  └───────────────────────────────┘
              │ audio (ch 1–16)
┌─────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  VIRTUAL ROUTING LAYER                                          │
│  BlackHole 64ch (audio) + IAC Driver (MIDI)                    │
│  Aggregate Device (combines physical + BlackHole)              │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 4.2 Audio channel mapping (Stage 5 onward)

| SC output ch | Content | Ableton track |
|---|---|---|
| 1–2 | Live autotuned stereo mix | "Input Autotuned" |
| 3–4 | Loop 1 | "Loop 1" |
| 5–6 | Loop 2 | "Loop 2" |
| 7–8 | Loop 3 | "Loop 3" |
| 9–10 | Loop 4 | "Loop 4" |
| 11–12 | Granular FX bus | "Granular" |
| 13–14 | Dry/diagnostic | (unused, reserved) |
| 15–16 | Reserved | (future) |

