**How to use this document in a new session:**

If you are a human or AI opening this for the first time: read §1 (Executive Summary), §9 (Current Implementation Status), and §8 (Stage Specifications) for the stage you are working on. Everything else is reference. If you are an AI agent, the human should still give you a fresh stage prompt following §10; do not treat this document as your prompt. It is the reference the human reads from when composing your prompt.